acceptance_criteria: "Reproduce public SDK creation in a sandbox with saved focus and explicit/omitted/unset parent controls; Define and document SDK focus inheritance policy without silently changing CLI convenience; Make applied ambient defaults and parent provenance discoverable through types/help/receipt; Verify importer-style Node/Bun consumers and CLI/MCP parity, including templates, tags, assignee and workflow defaults."
